y because I didn't  quite love him in the Doctor Strange  solo movie but he wasn't a bad adversary  really also strange didn't defeat this  god of another universe he just made a  deal with him Dormammu made a similar  deal with strange in the past in the  comics and he usually figures out a  multitude of ways to manipulate his way  back into our universe by influencing or  even possessing individuals and giving  them power he's even gone up against  embodiments of our multiverse and one  yeah so he's no joke now seeing a threat  so large in cosmic attacking universe  definitely sounds like a threat that  would need more than just a group of  sorcerers possibly a team to help out  let me know what you think now I didn't  want to make this top six list so here's  my honorable mention Magus this is the  embodiment of all the negative parts of  Adam warlock / Adam warlocks eventual  future self depending on who the  storyteller is now Adam warlock has been  teased for guardians the galaxy vol 3  he's basically space Jesus he's with an  insanely powerful cosmic comic-book  character but so as Magus Megas is his  opposite he wouldn't be an easy threat  to take down and it could lead to him  possibly organizing other cosmic  societies against earth and the  Guardians but there you have it what do  you think of my definitive list of  possible phase 4 villains who do you  think is the next logical villain to be  picked let me know in the comments  down below but make sure you like  subscribe check out our other videos and  hit that notification icon to stay up to  date when we release stuff sending your  ideas on Twitter at Sam basher I'll see  you guys next time bye bye  [Music]

